{
  "analysis": "The review mainly describes misleading advertising for pin-pull and mini-game content, which is out of scope under R13 because it concerns what the game advertises rather than an in-game design mechanic. The reviewer also explicitly describes paying real money for extra coins, establishing a real-money-to-virtual-currency conversion and therefore Intermediate Currency. The purchase is not described as directly unlocking progress, so Pay to Progress is not supported. The required updates taking days to reconnect are attributed to a technical/connection problem, so they do not generate a dark-pattern label. Being over level 4000 and finding mini-games rare does not by itself establish Infinite Treadmill or another coded mechanic.",
